DESCRIPTION:Join us every Saturday for hands-on gardening projects at the McGovern Centennial Gardens. From 8 a.m. to 11 a.m.\, come help with seasonal tasks like planting\, weeding\, mulching\, and pruning. A great way to connect with others and make a visible impact in the Park! \nNo experience needed. All ages are welcome. \nMeet at the Family Garden in McGovern Centennial Gardens. \n Click here to sign up!
