SUMMARY:September 11 National Day of Service
DESCRIPTION:Join Hermann Park Conservancy on Friday\, September 11\, from 9:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m. for a meaningful morning of service in Hermann Park. \nIn recognition of the 9/11 National Day of Service and Remembrance\, volunteers will unite for good by participating in hands-on projects that help care for and beautify the Park. Projects may include gardening\, planting\, mulching\, litter removal\, and other seasonal maintenance activities. \nTogether\, we will honor the spirit of service\, strengthen our community\, and make a lasting impact on one of Houston’s most treasured public spaces. All tools and project instructions will be provided. \nSign up for a session at McGovern Centennial Gardens\, the Commons\, or the Heart of the Park HERE.
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/september-11-national-day-of-service/
LOCATION:McGovern Centennial Gardens\, 1500 Hermann Drive\, Houston\, TX\, 77004\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/mcg_mount4-e1757000165605.jpg
END:VEVENT
