SUMMARY:Kathrine McGovern Day of Service
DESCRIPTION:Known for her kindness and lifelong dedication to service\, Kathrine G. McGovern\, along with her late husband\, John P. McGovern\, MD\, helped shape Houston into the vibrant\, compassionate city it is today. \nOn Tuesday\, September 15\, we invite you to celebrate her birthday by giving back to one of the places she loved most — the McGovern Centennial Gardens. Bring your friends\, family\, and your spirit of service. Together\, we’ll honor Mrs. McGovern’s memory in the most meaningful way: by caring for the community she cherished. \nVolunteer with us and help continue her legacy through gardening\, beautification\, and stewardship projects that keep the Gardens thriving and welcoming to all. \nSign up for this session in the McGovern Centennial Gardens HERE.
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/kathrine-mcgovern-day-of-service/
LOCATION:McGovern Centennial Gardens\, 1500 Hermann Drive\, Houston\, TX\, 77004\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/mcg_mount4-e1757000165605.jpg
END:VEVENT
