SUMMARY:Garden & Nature Series: Birdscaping with Native Plants
DESCRIPTION:Discover how to turn your outdoor space into a haven for local and migrating birds. Participants will learn how native plants support birds by providing essential food\, shelter\, and nesting resources. The program will include a guided garden walk\, practical habitat-building tips\, and a hands-on activity to help guests begin creating their own bird-friendly space. \nThursday\, Sept. 24\n6:30 – 7:30 p.m.\nMcGovern Centennial Gardens – Family Garden (1500 Hermann Drive\, Houston\, TX 77004) \nRSVP FOR THIS FREE EVENT HERE. \n 
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/garden-nature-series-birdscaping-with-native-plants/
LOCATION:McGovern Centennial Gardens\, 1500 Hermann Drive\, Houston\, TX\, 77004\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/mcg_family_garden_-_photo_by_lifted_up_aerial_photography-680x400-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
