SUMMARY:Sound Bath with Daemein Smith (Prioritizing Peace)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a peaceful morning experience in Hermann Park with a free guided Sound Bath led by Daemein Smith of Prioritizing Peace. Set against the natural beauty of the Tsuru Family Terrace in the Commons\, this immersive meditation experience uses sound and vibration to promote relaxation\, mindfulness\, and emotional well-being. Guests are encouraged to slow down\, reset\, and “Prioritize Peace” through a calming journey of sound healing in nature. \n Tsuru Family Terrace\n Saturday\, September 26\n 8 – 9 a.m.\n Free Community Session \nGuests are encouraged to bring a yoga mat if available. Blankets and pillows are also recommended for additional comfort. All ages and experience levels welcome. \nParking: Free parking available across the street from the Commons in Lot S (6215 Main St\, Houston\, TX 77030). Additional street parking available along Main Street.
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizing-peace-14/
LOCATION:The Commons
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/P4060009-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
